# Client Configuration Schema

This table contains all business rules used by Talent Prism to evaluate applicants. Every row represents one organization, agency, or brand. Before an application is processed, the platform loads the corresponding configuration profile and uses these values throughout the AI evaluation, scoring, ranking, qualification, and workflow pipeline.

