## ⚠️ Important

This table is directly connected to the Talent Prism platform.

Every automation workflow, AI prompt, scoring engine, and qualification process depends on the values stored here. Changes made to this table immediately affect how future applications are evaluated.

Only Platform Administrators, Operations Managers, Talent Directors, or Technical Administrators should modify this configuration.

Avoid:

- Renaming existing columns.
- Deleting columns referenced by workflows.
- Changing the structure of JSON fields.
- Modifying scoring weights without understanding their impact.
- Editing production values without testing in a development environment.

The configuration table is the single source of truth for business rules. Treat it as production infrastructure rather than a simple spreadsheet.